	"¡Listo, jefe! Voy contigo. Pulsa H y te digo qué hacer.": "Ready, boss! I'm coming with you. Press H and I'll tell you what to do.",
	"FOCOS a tu lado. Si me necesitas, pulsa H.": "FOCOS by your side. If you need me, press H.",
